{"seq":50,"at":"2026-10-23","kind":"corrected","target":{"type":"fact","id":"f14581"},"reason":"The timeline label said the concert drew about 1.5 million people. Sources disagree (1.3 million in Jarre's official biography and the Houston Chronicle, 1.5 million on Wikipedia), so the label now gives the range 1.3 to 1.5 million.","by":"provenance-research","sources":[{"url":"https://www.jeanmicheljarre.com/biography"}],"changes":[{"field":"timeline","old":{"labelEn":"Jean-Michel Jarre's \"Rendez-vous Houston\" concert draws about 1.5 million people","labelDe":"Jean-Michel Jarres Konzert „Rendez-vous Houston“ zieht rund 1,5 Millionen Menschen an","labelRu":"Концерт Жан-Мишеля Жарра «Rendez-vous Houston» собирает около 1,5 миллиона человек"},"new":{"labelEn":"Jean-Michel Jarre's \"Rendez-vous Houston\" concert draws an estimated 1.3 to 1.5 million people","labelDe":"Jean-Michel Jarres Konzert „Rendez-vous Houston“ zieht schätzungsweise 1,3 bis 1,5 Millionen Menschen an","labelRu":"Концерт Жан-Мишеля Жарра «Rendez-vous Houston» собирает, по оценкам, от 1,3 до 1,5 миллиона человек"}}],"hash":"eb319afdf60e","actor":{"kind":"agent","name":"provenance-research"},"run":"provenance-research-2026-10-23","chain":"8381092b913b20a075ead859586825c4d03ba1d8e2f8bafc5c1c8d3da3084584"},
{"seq":51,"at":"2026-10-23","kind":"reworded","target":{"type":"wording","id":"w14896"},"reason":"The question asked about 'an estimated 1.5 million people', a figure only some sources give (Jarre's official biography says 1.3 million). 'More than a million people' is true under every estimate.","by":"provenance-research","sources":[{"url":"https://www.jeanmicheljarre.com/biography"},{"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rendez-vous_Houston"}],"changes":[{"field":"en","old":"Which French electronic musician drew an estimated 1.5 million people to an open-air concert in Houston in 1986?","new":"Which French electronic musician drew more than a million people to an open-air concert in Houston in 1986?"},{"field":"de","old":"Welcher französische Elektronikmusiker lockte 1986 schätzungsweise 1,5 Millionen Menschen zu einem Open-Air-Konzert in Houston?","new":"Welcher französische Elektronikmusiker lockte 1986 mehr als eine Million Menschen zu einem Open-Air-Konzert in Houston?"},{"field":"ru","old":"Какой французский электронный музыкант в 1986 году собрал, по оценкам, 1,5 миллиона человек на концерт под открытым небом в Хьюстоне?","new":"Какой французский электронный музыкант в 1986 году собрал более миллиона человек на концерт под открытым небом в Хьюстоне?"}],"hash":"606cf968033f","actor":{"kind":"agent","name":"provenance-research"},"run":"provenance-research-2026-10-23","chain":"1d2c744da6b8b005eca4c8396b7f7fe358b75c21ddd6d986f1425f5908c232c1"},
